ven or edge-triggered.\"\n  },\n  \"priorities\": [\n    \"Invalid window detection overrides reset and sampling: report 16#8200 and preserve history, average, and windowSizeReached.\",\n    \"For a valid window, reset overrides sampling and clears history. Record the current valid window size even during reset.\",\n    \"A changed valid window clears history before any same-scan accepted sample. The first valid size is treated as a change from the initial sentinel.\",\n    \"Cyclic execution accepts one sample per valid, non-reset scan; trigger cannot cause a second insertion.\",\n    \"Update trigger edge history on every invocation, including cyclic, reset, and invalid-window scans.\"\n  ],\n  \"initial_values\": {\n    \"average\": 0.0,\n    \"windowSizeReached\": false,\n    \"error\": false,\n    \"status\": \"16#0000\",\n    \"sampleCount\": 0,\n    \"previousTrigger\": false,\n    \"activeWindowSize\": 0,\n    \"nextIndex\": 0,\n    \"mean\": 0.0,\n    \"sampleBuffer\": {\n      \"length\": 100,\n      \"element_initial_value\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"state\": \"EMPTY\"\n  },\n  \"scan_execution_order\": [\n    {\n      \"stage\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Edge sampling\",\n      \"actions\": [\n        \"Sample all inputs once.\",\n        \"Compute triggerRise = trigger AND NOT previousTrigger, then store the sampled trigger in previousTrigger unconditionally.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"stage\": 2,\n      \"name\": \"Safety/reset priority and state transitions\",\n      \"actions\": [\n        \"Check windowSize bounds. If invalid, preserve calculation state and select INVALID_WINDOW.\",\n        \"If valid, detect a change from activeWindowSize and record the current size. Clear history on reset or size change.\",\n        \"If valid and reset is FALSE, accept one sample when cyclicExecution OR triggerRise is TRUE; update the circular buffer, count, and mean.\",\n        \"Select EMPTY, FILLING, or FULL from the resulting count.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\